    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Threats_of_the_Galaxy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Threats of the Galaxy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Threats of the Galaxy</a></i> </p><p>Sweeping this small, handheld sensor over the subject's body produces a summary of the patient's vital signs. An MDS-50 Medisensor can be used as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> on an adjacent creature or character, providing the user with the target's current hit points, its place on the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>, and the presence of (but no specifics on) <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Disease\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disease\">Diseases</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Poison\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Poison\">Poison</a>, or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Radiation\" title=\"Radiation\">Radiation</a> exposure. </p>",
